&lt;h4 id=&#34;javascript-3d-library&#34;&gt;JavaScript 3D library
&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;The aim of the project is to create an easy-to-use, lightweight, cross-browser, general-purpose 3D library. The current builds only include WebGL and WebGPU renderers but SVG and CSS3D renderers are also available as addons.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://threejs.org/examples/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Examples&lt;/a&gt; —
